          "y": 178,
          "name": "Review Section Content 0",
          "fill": "#A8B6CF",
          "content": "汇总 HWS-3.3 商业背景，梳理关键词并产出汇报要点。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Urbanist",
          "fontSize": 12
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "k8H6B",
          "x": 809,
          "y": 223,
          "name": "Review Section Title 1",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "content": "市场需求",
          "textAlignVertical": "middle",
          "fontFamily": "Urbanist",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "m4Chu8",
          "x": 809,
          "y": 248,
          "name": "Review Section Content 1",
          "fill": "#A8B6CF",
          "content": "• 市场需求持续增长，尤其在中小企业服务领域\n• 主要是品类间 A、B 两类产品，服务差异化体现在智能化协同和数据可视化\n• 用户痛点集中在「信息分散、响应慢、缺乏有效跟踪」",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Urbanist",
          "fontSize": 12
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "v9jRq",
          "x": 809,
          "y": 334,
          "name": "Review Section Title 2",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "content": "核心洞察",
          "textAlignVertical": "middle",
          "fontFamily": "Urbanist",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cM8JG",
          "x": 809,
          "y": 359,
          "name": "Review Section Content 2",
          "fill": "#A8B6CF",
          "content": "1. 行业现状与机会\n2. 目标用户画像与核心需求\n3. 产品定位与差异化优势\n4. 商业模式和可行路径\n5. 下一步计划与资源需求",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Urbanist",
          "fontSize": 12
        },
